{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_title", "source_sha256": "c99d1e37e0c0a350c4674fbf45f61c591b066b292f842039652fa0a10fcde70b", "ja": "終わりのないキセキ", "zh": "永无止境的奇迹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ff9e8f2ce92ee4a1b578a0904eb39f027174610db0ff83c84c8219dcbd0156df", "ja": "765プロのアイドル達が出演した作品だけを\n集めた、リバイバル上映イベントが開催。\nイベントでアイドル達はそれぞれが出演した\n作品の思い出を語り、プロデューサーは\n改めて、アイドル達の成長を実感する。", "zh": "一场仅汇集765事务所偶像们出演过的\n作品的重映上映活动即将举办。\n偶像们在活动中畅谈各自出演作品的回忆，\n制作人也再次切实感受到了偶像们的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ef3a765b29798c2a96d1a81fb4f5c75753a0812371aac864942f09d690b0d274", "ja": "（1ヶ月間に渡るリバイバル上映イベントは、連日\n満員御礼！　みんなの舞台挨拶も大盛況だったな）", "zh": "（持续1个月的重映活动，每天都座无虚席！大家的舞台问候也大获成功啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "c5830fd3e16d4bf7a04dadc20331df20cab88b7fe622a0158061a9af985a6912", "ja": "おやぶん、おやぶん！\nたまきたちの舞台あいさつ、見ててくれた？", "zh": "老大，老大！\n你有来看小环她们的舞台致辞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1002_p", "source_sha256": "50e1988d96a5be0e83793949200077ee93fd2da6c5b86601db9f9aaee1c05be9", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\n可憐もお疲れさま！", "zh": "啊，当然。\n可怜也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "21d24f33d514987581aa048eef3741cea3b276bf2d558b34d6c7890d91ddab99", "ja": "は、はい……！　き、緊張しましたけど……\n映画の話ができて、とっても楽しかったです……♪", "zh": "是、是的……！虽、虽然有点紧张……\n但能聊到电影，我真的特别开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "661bf9a01c028c0aa8aa91c9bde5d1cf26fd27dea9ded32daae67c8bb5bad520", "ja": "なんでも、今回の舞台挨拶の記事などを見て、\n映画に興味を持ってくださった方もいるとか……。", "zh": "听说还有人看了这次首映礼之类的报道，对电影产生了兴趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "eb177b9a5b3dd41a6de2298481364b43fd5d8ddec801da3906cc14a2595fd815", "ja": "それって、ワタシたちの声が届いたってことだよネ？\nうれしいナ～♪", "zh": "这就说明，我们的声音传达到了吧？\n好开心呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "85d3e11c1f03ef6148cef8671341e2c937ea2de48ca07cdaa70f10a58975f5e7", "ja": "ホンマやな！　お客さんたちもみんな\nニコニコしとったし、ええイベントやったわ♪", "zh": "确实啊！客人们也全都笑眯眯的，\n真是场精彩的活动呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "f868772af9c97cda7444526d2cdb1a2f56a085e0b8ea26645a69d577c6ad7544", "ja": "はい！　みなさまと、素晴らしい作品の数々を\n再び観ることができて、とても幸せでした♪", "zh": "是的！能和大家一起再次欣赏这么多精彩的作品，我真的感到非常幸福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "e4bcba8e86de2dabb1753a9417c5fdaff9b29429e46cc9c0fc10e0ec09fffa41", "ja": "せやけど、みんな！\nなんか大事なこと忘れてへん？", "zh": "不过，大家！\n是不是忘了什么重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "31240c1f498f1aab88add4b769e62848fd5ad7f100c1ff46be1c71cd0e162c7f", "ja": "大事なコト……？\n{$P$}、なんかあったっけ？", "zh": "重要的事情……？\n{$P$}，有什么事来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1010_p", "source_sha256": "027bb95205b82355013d85aff59473baef2a88c9a0b38f0ced10b84427f0282a", "ja": "いや、特にないと思うけど……あっ。\nもしかして、打ち上げの事か？", "zh": "不，应该没什么特别的事才对……啊。\n难道说，是指庆功宴的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "7c69797646268088151bae08cea9a85b47e50d7f6eaef987371138885a2fc613", "ja": "う、打ち上げ……今回の、リバイバル上映イベントの\n成功を、祝して……ということでしょうか……？", "zh": "庆、庆功宴……是为了庆祝这次重映活动\n圆满成功……的意思吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5c17c62fd2a5ab3aceeb1f241fc4e6ac6de35613465fdb20593a770e07e76e2b", "ja": "よし、わかった！\nみんな頑張ってくれたし、今日は奮発するぞ！", "zh": "好，我知道了！\n大家都这么努力，今天我就好好犒赏一下大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "844eb99dbf7e1f163f0c7c676c7c3d34953878f9d4d70899a253a6b84af5dc3b", "ja": "ほんと！？　やったー！\nたまき、お肉食べたい！", "zh": "真的！？太好了！\n环吃肉肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7c4b6deaf489ff4b54cddde69acfdad9fad3d876b9ca02196534d3d3cbb2882f", "ja": "お肉か、いいな。\nみんなは？　食べたいものはないのか？", "zh": "吃肉啊，不错。\n大家呢？没有想吃的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "d8ef5f4c8563558bcd310471a96d9a59be740092a3974345732505fd1ec70351", "ja": "細やかなお心遣い、ありがとうございます♪\nでは私は、お魚が……。", "zh": "谢谢您如此细心地为我着想♪那我想吃鱼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "f0f06c90c31fd48e593f79ef28fd8fc88acb01477f2a9228cdc1d1d77bd77308", "ja": "みんなが食べたいもん、全部食べられる\n店がええなぁ。スマホで調べてみるわ！", "zh": "要是能有家店，能把大家想吃的东西\n全吃到就好了呢。我用手机查查看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c504860d64325bc0d6947472a9e1e1eeff65b2a094107d188549a9302e281f89", "ja": "ありがとう、奈緒。でも肉とお魚両方食べられる店は、\n難しそうな気が……。", "zh": "谢谢你，奈绪。不过要找一家肉和鱼都能吃到的店，\n感觉挺难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "e3796dcbd9c293dd85b25a093572c5368b730236cec4338e2965949efa84bfef", "ja": "{$P$}さん、近くにありましたよ！\n『焼肉とお寿司が食べられる超高級店』やって！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，附近就有一家哦！\n说是“既能吃烤肉又能吃寿司的超高级店”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "d44ce5a995d0d7f03d9f25fb11c33cb71b6f63b75143c154a1257024af4e9ac4", "ja": "あー、ホントだ～！\nよかったネ、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，真的耶～！\n太好啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3f50edf6734555b9adf11cbedd6d065ca83a9d3493d54769642e86806799dfd2", "ja": "あ、ああ。そうだな……。\n超、高級店……。", "zh": "啊，啊啊。是啊……。\n超、高级的店……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "ec6e5442ed33e4cb877565a8b7391840192ae4433eeda2696b0aaaac610a71b7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いいんでしょうか……？\nな、なんだか、高そうなお店ですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，真的可以吗……？\n总、总觉得这是一家很贵的店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c8e31cc63034dfdcdd82d8b4bf8a9e3ff76115fc9ae5f36a9617ef5b83c069d4", "ja": "あ、ああ！　お祝いだから問題ないぞ！\nははは……。", "zh": "啊、啊！因为是庆祝嘛，没问题！\n哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "76098bcd32362f18679384901a872707ed1bf7448629bc3ffb8894b664310a68", "ja": "そうと決まれば……\nみんな、行くヨ～！", "zh": "既然决定了……大家，出发啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3b7769a6d54e74da4f394c31d6caf5bb900da4551e6a62daf59057b378498db5", "ja": "ははは……あれ、もういない。\nみんな足が速いな……。", "zh": "哈哈哈……咦，已经不见了。\n大家走得真快啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "41aa5760c987a985503d66a785df3bf263352061800bc33034ba5b9f3d259951", "ja": "……おやぶん！", "zh": "……老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8231bb6e387a898995c7045fee3533359f8dc5eccb6ecb38633d8fc8d216b52b", "ja": "おっ、環。\nどうした、みんなと行かないのか？", "zh": "哦，环。\n怎么了，不和大家一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "440ef8fcac110c8bc4e8c19bd1b50ea94ab72e1ec2cdd8ff0584ff6f97906503", "ja": "えっと……。おやぶん！\nたまきたちを映画に出してくれて、ありがとう！", "zh": "那个……老大！\n谢谢你让环和大家出演电影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1028_p", "source_sha256": "85c35ee56df0affb3f033b37309b46b061060322f4850b1810e8790cd57d5e97", "ja": "どういたしまして。\n……どうしたんだ？　改まって。", "zh": "不用客气。\n……怎么了？突然这么郑重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "388794018c8918c66d0f5a1619137e9a7e7ba7449d947cbd7e03caaf90893e51", "ja": "どうして？　……なんか、言いたくなったから！\nあとね、たまき、おやぶんとお仕事するの大好き！", "zh": "为什么？……就是突然想说了嘛！\n还有哦，环，最喜欢和老大一起工作了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "8bd4da93cca72e6748f8f0f814a736d02338ae7b5006696f38347d36bbc01c7e", "ja": "だからこれからも、いっぱいお仕事しようね！\nくふふっ♪", "zh": "所以以后也要一起做很多工作哦！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1031_p", "source_sha256": "05c1140f864661508c6b018576dca7a76a4add7392a89b5740c1881b87e2a714", "ja": "環……。", "zh": "环……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3c2965a1381c76a702e70c3a42884d8179ab780c27f13443da1ef453e40ef8f1", "ja": "（映画の物語やイベントに終わりはあっても、\n彼女たち自身の物語に終わりはない……）", "zh": "（电影的故事和活动或许会有结束，\n但她们自己的故事不会结束……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_139_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f5606c84a9f9a7c96b49b7101fc16987ad2ca9b898aa7a18af87ccce177d8db5", "ja": "（感謝の気持ちを伝えたら、この先へ行こう。\n決して終わることのない、物語の先へ……！）", "zh": "（传达谢意之后，就继续向前走吧。走向那永远不会结束的故事的未来……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
